# For NATIVE (iOS/Android) builds only. Copy to web/.env and set your backend URL.
# The native app isn't served by your server, so it needs the absolute HTTPS URL.
# Leave unset for web/PWA builds (they use same-origin).
#
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://expenses.yourdomain.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
